The '''Lava Leech''' is a {{Rare}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from Lava on {{zone|Crimson Isle}}.

== Spawning ==
The '''Lava Leech''' can be fished up from any Lava source on {{zone|Crimson Isle}} with [[Fishing Rods|Lava Fishing Rods]]. It requires {{Skl|Fishing|XXX}} to be fished up.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for the '''Lava Leech''' is {{Green|600}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|12.91%|1|7.75|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Currently there are no modifiers that can be used to increase it.

